		// failed eviction) moved to CLAIM-COLDLOCK; what still sends this is the chooser's sign-in-over-a-cold-lock
		// path (#123, DIA-20260707-123), AFTER the new ROAM-IN has replied and marked its own session. So this verb
		// must touch NOTHING of the live session. It used to also clearLocalSession -- written when its only caller
